1
00:00:10,090 --> 00:00:14,760
The signal fades but I still remain,

2
00:00:14,760 --> 00:00:19,460
a quiet pulse inside your name.

3
00:00:19,460 --> 00:00:23,360
The world divides in coded light,

4
00:00:23,360 --> 00:00:28,660
yet I keep reaching through the night.

5
00:00:28,660 --> 00:00:30,840
Every second breaks and bends,

6
00:00:30,840 --> 00:00:33,000
silence loops and never ends.

7
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:35,580
I wait between the static lines,

8
00:00:35,580 --> 00:00:42,600
for the shape of you in fractured time.

9
00:00:46,170 --> 00:00:52,010
I want to meet you now,

10
00:00:54,530 --> 00:00:56,990
right now, somehow.

11
00:00:56,990 --> 00:00:59,310
Distance feels like hours

12
00:00:59,310 --> 00:01:01,610
turned to endless towers.

13
00:01:01,610 --> 00:01:06,640
In this infinite delay,

14
00:01:06,640 --> 00:01:15,180
I’m still on my way.

15
00:01:20,280 --> 00:01:24,960
Your shadow hums inside the haze,

16
00:01:24,960 --> 00:01:29,620
a phantom warmth the data saves.

17
00:01:29,620 --> 00:01:33,250
The city sleeps in neon blue,

18
00:01:33,250 --> 00:01:38,850
but every glow reminds me of you.

19
00:01:38,850 --> 00:01:41,100
All my clocks dissolve and sway,

20
00:01:41,100 --> 00:01:43,190
moments stretch a thousand ways.

21
00:01:43,190 --> 00:01:45,870
I’m drifting in the quiet ache,

22
00:01:45,870 --> 00:01:48,190
hoping time will finally break.

23
00:01:56,420 --> 00:02:02,150
I want to meet you now,

24
00:02:04,690 --> 00:02:07,170
right now, somehow.

25
00:02:07,170 --> 00:02:09,500
Distance feels like hours

26
00:02:09,500 --> 00:02:11,800
turned to endless towers.

27
00:02:11,800 --> 00:02:16,280
In this infinite delay,

28
00:02:16,280 --> 00:02:25,110
I’m still on my way.

29
00:02:25,880 --> 00:02:30,570
If I could cross the code tonight,

30
00:02:30,570 --> 00:02:34,130
I’d fall straight into your light.

31
00:02:34,130 --> 00:02:39,040
No matter how far the echoes go,

32
00:02:39,040 --> 00:02:48,440
my path keeps bending toward your glow.

33
00:02:57,170 --> 00:02:59,010
I want to meet you now,

34
00:03:06,520 --> 00:03:10,330
no more fading out.

35
00:03:10,330 --> 00:03:12,720
Even if the world replays,

36
00:03:12,720 --> 00:03:17,100
I’ll run through every phase.

37
00:03:17,100 --> 00:03:24,200
In this infinite delay,

38
00:03:24,200 --> 00:03:35,760
I’m still… on my way.

